矣！外舉不隱仇，内舉不隱子。」方會諸侯，悼公弟楊干亂行，魏絳戮其仆。悼公怒，或諫公，公卒賢絳，任之政，使和戎，戎大親附。十一年，悼公曰：「自吾用魏絳，九合諸侯，和戎、翟，魏子之力也。」賜之樂，三讓乃受之。冬，秦取我櫟。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p115","text":"三年，晉會諸侯。悼公問群臣可用者，祁傒舉解狐。解狐，傒之仇。復問，舉其子祁午。君子曰：「祁傒可謂不黨矣！外舉不隱仇，内舉不隱子。」方會諸侯，悼公弟楊干亂行，魏絳戮其仆。悼公怒，或諫公，公卒賢絳，任之政，使和戎，戎大親附。十一年，悼公曰：「自吾用魏絳，九合諸侯，和戎、翟，魏子之力也。」賜之樂，三讓乃受之。冬，秦取我櫟。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"祁傒","kind":"person","person_id":"dfq_kor_hpu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"解狐","kind":"person","person_id":"c2t_tz0_ic9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"解狐","kind":"person","person_id":"c2t_tz0_ic9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"傒","kind":"person","person_id":"dfq_kor_hpu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"祁午","kind":"person","person_id":"qje_fwa_r4b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"祁傒","kind":"person","person_id":"dfq_kor_hpu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"楊干","kind":"person","person_id":"u7o_pk8_4ra","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m115-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"魏絳","kind":"person","person_id":"67k_3wh_j8c","status":"contextual_provision